# Generated self-test scratch (W7G TASK 11). Written under the repo root by
# ai-routing/Test-AiRoutingFoundation.ps1 (logs/selftest/db-m14-serialize) and
# ai-routing/AttemptStore.ps1 (logs/tasks/<node>/<change>/ai-attempts/). No file under
# logs/ has ever been tracked in this repository - checked with
# `git log --all --diff-filter=A -- 'logs/*'`, which is empty - so this rule records what
# was already true rather than changing what is committed. Forge's .gitignore carries the
# same rule for the same directories; this repo was simply missing it, which is what left
# the directory showing as untracked in the W7F.2 exit record.
/logs/
